    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "ויקרא לו נחשתן",
      "rationale": "Yessawel-as Neḥuctan: mačči d isem amezwaru, neɣ d tazwart n tneɣlit — 'yessawel-as d uẓran kan' (ylt) neɣ 'yettwassan s' (jps)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "מקטרים",
      "rationale": "Qaṭṭer: ad yexli cceḥḥ deg tmes i usifer — 'ssnuyen ixsan' d taneɣruft tameqqrant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "hapax",
      "subject": "נחשתן",
      "rationale": "Neḥuctan i d-yettban kan dagi deg Tanakh."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Netta i d-yessuffɣen ⟨את⟩ tiggi, i d-yerrẓen ⟨את⟩ yijguten, i d-yegren ⟨את⟩ taḥancict n Acerah, i d-yessenduḥen lweḥc n uweḥc aẓrani i d-yexleq Moce, acku arma d wussan-agi llan wid n Yisrael ssnuyen ixsan i wesifesf; yessawel-as Neḥuctan.",
